# Credentials: excluded by pattern, not by path, so a file added later
# (e.g. a new package's provider secrets) is excluded by default instead
# of by someone remembering to list it. packages/ingress-reverse-proxy's
# ini/cloudflare.ini and ini/godaddy.ini are the ones known today, but this
# is intentionally broader than that.
**/*.ini
**/.env
**/.env.*
